      padding-block: 2.2rem 3rem;
    }
    /* Technical reading is released to the full container width. */
    .prod-body { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
    /* The rail no longer needs to travel: it sits beside a masthead of
       comparable height rather than beside 3,500px of scrolling text. */
    .prod-media-sticky { position: sticky; top: 90px; }
    /* Same warm neutral frame as ProductCard's .card-img — the supplied
       product photos are full marketing posters on a light background, and
       the old near-black gradient here clashed with every one of them at
       this large, highly visible size. Matching the poster's own tone
       instead makes the whole frame read as an intentional light "photo
       plate," not a colour mismatch — kept in the same gold-bordered plate
       treatment as before. */
    /* The frame takes its ratio from the artwork (set per page in the
       frontmatter as --prod-ar), so a landscape poster is no longer
       letterboxed inside a square and a portrait bottle shot is no longer
       pillarboxed. Falls back to square if the variable is ever absent. */
    .prod-img {
