       already used for .cat-block/.article-section/.gp-case-study lands it
       cleanly below the header instead, same as any other in-page jump. */
    .enquire-sec { position: relative; scroll-margin-top: 90px; background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, var(--bg-2) 64px); }
    .enquire-sec::before {
